  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. <br>• Thinly slice leek. <br>• Finely chop garlic. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395559f7d5496ac4a6ed14/step-7f0fd200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. Add a generous pinch of salt, <br>then bring to the boil over high heat. Cook risoni in boiling water until <br>‘al dente’, 7-8 minutes. <br>• Reserve some pasta water(see ingredients), then drain and return risoni<br>to the saucepan with a drizzle of olive oil. <br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395559f7d5496ac4a6ed14/step-1f8e6910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p> While risoni is cooking, heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle <br>of olive oil. Cook sliced mushrooms and leek, stirring, until browned and <br>softened, 5-6 minutes. <br>• Add garlic, herb &amp; mushroom seasoning and the butter and cook until <br>fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Reduce heat to low, then add stock concentrate, light cooking cream, <br>baby spinach leaves, the reserved pasta water and cooked risoni. <br>Simmer, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minute. Season with salt and pepper.<br>TIP: Add an extra splash of water if the mixture looks too thick.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395559f7d5496ac4a6ed14/step-9b3f1a20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy mushroom risoni between bowls. <br>• Top with Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395559f7d5496ac4a6ed14/step-3499f630.jpg"
    }
  ]
